# Store and check out every text file with LF line endings, on every OS.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checks files out with CRLF. The rendered HTML is
# always LF, so test:text then reports the snapshots in test/fixtures/__snapshots__ as changed even
# though nothing did. It also keeps diffs free of whole-file line-ending churn between contributors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch line endings, never try to diff as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
